  "job_B19.1_20251003_114440": {
    "chunk_text": "A4 \u00deone halgan Stefanus Cristes \u00feegnas gehalgodon to diacone, ac Iudeas hine eft mi\u00f0 stanum DE26A8 Ond \u00fea hi Stefanus to \u00fe\u00e6re st\u00e6ninge l\u00e6ddon, \u00fea mihte he locian on heofnas, ond he geseah DE26A11 Ond he hit \u00feam Iudeum s\u00e6de, ond hi him micle \u00fee re\u00f0ran on w\u00e6ron ond \u00fee ra\u00feor hine DE26A13 \u00dea leton hi his lichaman licgan butan Hierusalem \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre, ond woldon \u00fe\u00e6t hine fuglas DE26A17 \u00dea bebirigde hine sum geleafful man, se w\u00e6s haten Gamaliel. DE26A20 Ond \u00fea \u00e6fter manegum gearum w\u00e6s se lichama geci\u00f0ed \u00feurh heofonlicu tacn, ond \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s DE26A21 \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s sanctus Stefnanus wundra sum \u00fe\u00e6t an plegende cild arn under w\u00e6nes hweowol DE26A23 \u00dea nam \u00fe\u00e6s cild modor \u00feone deadan lichaman ond wearp on sanctus Stefanus circean \u00fe\u00e6r DE26A26 \u00dea heo eft com, \u00fea mitte heo hire cild lifiende ond gesund. DE27A1 On \u00feone III d\u00e6ig bi\u00f0 Sancte Iohannes tid \u00fe\u00e6s godspellres, se w\u00e6s Criste leof ofer ealle o\u00fere DE27A3 Ond II beorgas litelra stana he gesenode to \u00e6\u00feelum gymmum. DE27A5 And rice h\u00e6\u00feene men hine snidon \u00fe\u00e6t he dranc ator, on \u00feam was \u00e6lces cynnes wirm o\u00f0\u00f0e DE27A8 Ond his birgen is mid Grecum on Effessio \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre. DE27A10 \u00c6t \u00fe\u00e6re gyrgine bi\u00f0 wellmicel wundor gesewen ond geh",
